# Credentials. This skill needs none - its scripts make no network calls and market data comes
# through an MCP connector - so anything matching these is here by accident. Blocked at the
# source rather than caught in review, because a secret is only un-committed by rewriting history.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials.json
secrets.*
*_rsa
*_ed25519
.netrc
